Homepage: https://github.com/tedeler/ScreenMirror

Package: screenmirror
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: plasma-workspace
Description: mirror one Plasma screen onto the other
 ScreenMirror captures the screen that holds the KDE panel and shows
 it on the other output. The tray menu chooses Full, Zoom, or Black,
 and can stop the mirror without quitting.
 .
 The package installs the binary, the desktop entry KWin uses to
 authorize org.kde.KWin.ScreenShot2, and a Plasma autostart entry that
 launches the tray with --no-mirror.
